{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212290","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121229001:0":{"text":"알파 일레븐! 괜찮아?","source_cn":"阿尔法十一！你还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38C05B96569B82BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121229002:0":{"text":"몸이 아파... 사탕 좀 줘...","source_cn":"身体很痛……请给我一颗糖果……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC89C6BDAF03BF3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121229003:2":{"text":"알파 일레븐, 몸이 또 아프기 시작했니?","source_cn":"阿尔法十一，身体是不是又开始痛了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1533643EE937BBC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121229004:0":{"text":"응...","source_cn":"是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CFBC882AB0D9FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121229005:0":{"text":"...음, 고통을 느끼는 주기가 짧아졌구나.","source_cn":"……嗯，正常的时间变短了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7F23351E4FC9D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121229006:0":{"text":"너는 강한 아이니까, 참을 수 있지? 어서 엄마 곁으로 오렴. 엄마가 사탕을 줄게.","source_cn":"好了，你是个坚强的孩子。快到妈妈身边来吧，妈妈给你糖果吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DC5486D1C289C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121229007:0":{"text":"이 사탕만 먹으면 몸이 괜찮아질 거란다. 오늘은 두 개 더 먹으렴.","source_cn":"只要吃下糖果，一切都会好起来。这次要多吃两颗哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52CB7F3CDA76499A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121229008:1":{"text":"고마워요, 엄마...","source_cn":"谢谢妈妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54C7EA0C8E646EA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121229009:0":{"text":"사탕은 쓰지만... 먹기만 하면 몸이 아프지 않아.","source_cn":"虽然糖果很苦……但是只要吃下去，身体就不痛了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F126A75B1B7AE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121229010:0":{"text":"이봐, 이봐... 사탕은 달콤한 거잖아? 네가 먹은 건 사탕이 아니었을 거야! 넌 속은 거라고!","source_cn":"喂喂喂……糖果是甜的吧？那肯定不是什么糖果！你被骗了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6611115CC763923","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121229011:0":{"text":"엄마가 날 속였을 리 없어...","source_cn":"妈妈不会骗我的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF731BE4864EAF33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121229012:0":{"text":"아든 현자님! 알파 일레븐이 왜 이러는 거죠?","source_cn":"雅顿贤者！她这是怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC9FEE6A4EBA0D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121229013:0":{"text":"흑마법의 부작용인 듯하구나.","source_cn":"是黑魔法的副作用。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EC4FAEEE3CC736D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121229014:2":{"text":"이루시카가 무슨 짓을 했는지는 모르겠지만... 알파 일레븐의 몸이 오랫동안 흑마법에 잠식당한 건 알겠구나.","source_cn":"不知道伊露西卡具体对她做了什么……但是可以看出，她的身...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x916B74919D33AA32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121229015:0":{"text":"저 아이가 먹던 사탕은 아마 부작용을 억제해 주는 마법 약일게다.","source_cn":"她吃的糖果应该是一种魔药，能够抑制住这些副作用。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE67D1FCB69F5EAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121229016:0":{"text":"알파 일레븐, 미안하지만, 네가 지금 몇 살인지 아니?","source_cn":"阿尔法十一，冒昧问一句，你知道自己多大吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91C0C18337B9E694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1121229017:0":{"text":"몰라요... 몇 살인지 몰라요.","source_cn":"我不知道……我不记得自己的年龄。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB65FEDE2D4762C24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1121229018:0":{"text":"휴... 라이카, 레미아. 곧장 달빛호수 마을로 가서 다프니를 찾아가 보거라.","source_cn":"唉……莱卡、蕾米雅，你们先去一趟月湖村，去找达赫妮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA7F66D7DF3D6E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1121229019:0":{"text":"지금 너희와 바투소 산맥에 가기엔 이 아이의 상태가 너무 좋지 않아.","source_cn":"这孩子现在的状态，没法和你们一起去瓦度索山脉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCD98CD77CE72FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1121229020:0":{"text":"브라이언, 엘로나를 찾아가 내 편지를 다프니에게 전하라고 하렴. 어떻게 해야 할지 알고 있을 게다.","source_cn":"布莱恩，你让艾洛娜把我的手信捎给达赫妮，她知道该怎么做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5FAC94F2712B317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1121229021:0":{"text":"네, 현자님.","source_cn":"是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A937FC73CA79F89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn"